      "hyperlink": null,
      "label": "text",
      "meta": null,
      "orig": "P.P.S. I’m going to try to take a month off when baby arrives (early June 🤞), and since I don’t get parental leave (a downside of solopreneur life), I’m putting out a call for guest posts. Many of my most popular posts were guest posts, and I’ve never put out a public call for submissions. I’m excited to see what comes in. No prior writing experience required, but the bar is high.",
      "parent": {
        "$ref": "#/body"
      },
      "prov": [],
      "self_ref": "#/texts/10",
      "text": "P.P.S. I’m going to try to take a month off when baby arrives (early June 🤞), and since I don’t get parental leave (a downside of solopreneur life), I’m putting out a call for guest posts. Many of my most popular posts were guest posts, and I’ve never put out a public call for submissions. I’m excited to see what comes in. No prior writing experience required, but the bar is high."
    },
